Description: gst-plugins-good: gstspectrum
Version: 1.22.8
Requires: gstreamer-base-1.0 >=  1.22.0, gstreamer-fft-1.0 >=  1.22.0, gstreamer-audio-1.0 >=  1.22.0
Libs: -L${prefix}/lib/gstreamer-1.0 -lgstspectrum -lm
Cflags: -I${includedir}
